1. UART driver
--------------

  drivers/serial/uart_agm.c

is a native driver written against the publicly documented ARM PrimeCell
PL011 register map (DR / RSR / FR / IBRD / FBRD / LCR_H / CR / IMSC /
RIS / MIS / ICR — see dts/riscv/agm/agrv2k.dtsi for the address). No
source from upstream Zephyr is copied into this file.

The remaining drivers (drivers/{can,counter,dma,i2c,pwm,usb/udc,watchdog})
and the SoC glue (soc/agm/agrv2k/) are written for this module; they link
against, but do not copy, in-tree Zephyr code (can_sja1000.c,
udc_common.c); that dependency list is in `the development notes
(not published here)`.

